{
  "id": "banner-advertisement",
  "term": "banner advertisement",
  "definition": "A banner advertisement is an online display ad used to promote a product or brand on a webpage. In psychology research on attention, it is often studied as a visual stimulus that may attract or fail to attract viewers’ notice and can influence what parts of the ad people look at and how they judge the advertised product.",
